.TH man 1 "August 2025" "jellyfin-autorefresh-new-releases"
.SH NAME
jellyfin-autorefresh-new-releases
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR --version ", " -V
Display version information and exit.
.SH CONFIG
There should be a config file named config.json in the $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/jellyfin-autorefresh-new-releases/ directory.
It should be a valid json file with "jellyfinURL", "apiKey", "desiredImageHeight", and "daysToScan"
entries. Optionally, a "hyperlinkDomain" entry may be added for clickable episode names.
It's recommended that you use a local/internal URI for better performance.
